(6942185, 1045675, 78196, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and DoF effect. Lack of a specific focal point may hurt this in the voting, though.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and DoF effect. Lack of a specific focal point may hurt this in the voting, though.', '2012-12-26 19:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942187, 1046357, 78196, '<td valign="top">Rather tenuous link to the challenge, and although your pastawork is pleasing, there isn''t enough photographically to sustain the viewer''s interest IMO</td>', 'Rather tenuous link to the challenge, and although your pastawork is pleasing, there isn''t enough photographically to sustain the viewer''s interest IMO', '2012-12-26 19:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942189, 1046339, 78196, '<td valign="top">Excellent textures, colours and composition.  The HDR works on the whole, though I wonder if the uppermost buoy looks a little unnatural, though hard to judge without seeing the original.</td>', 'Excellent textures, colours and composition.  The HDR works on the whole, though I wonder if the uppermost buoy looks a little unnatural, though hard to judge without seeing the original.', '2012-12-26 19:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942191, 1046185, 78196, '<td valign="top">Well considered and composed.  I''m not sure about the white background - it gives a studio feel to what is otherwise a natural scene.  Nice though :)</td>', 'Well considered and composed.  I''m not sure about the white background - it gives a studio feel to what is otherwise a natural scene.  Nice though :)', '2012-12-26 19:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942193, 1046113, 78196, '<td valign="top">DoF very nicely judged</td>', 'DoF very nicely judged', '2012-12-26 19:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942194, 1046249, 78196, '<td valign="top">Perfect depth of field, nicely festive approach to challenge.  If I could vote, this would score highly :)</td>', 'Perfect depth of field, nicely festive approach to challenge.  If I could vote, this would score highly :)', '2012-12-26 19:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942198, 1046318, 78196, '<td valign="top">Others may disagree, but I really like the imagination with which you''ve approached the challenge :)</td>', 'Others may disagree, but I really like the imagination with which you''ve approached the challenge :)', '2012-12-26 19:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942199, 1046187, 78196, '<td valign="top">A nice idea but the execution needs a bit more imagination.</td>', 'A nice idea but the execution needs a bit more imagination.', '2012-12-26 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942204, 1046384, 78196, '<td valign="top">Lovely huts and well composed.  It''s a personal thing, but there are just a couple of places in the image (the dog, highlights in the sky) where the HDR seems a little too much.</td>', 'Lovely huts and well composed.  It''s a personal thing, but there are just a couple of places in the image (the dog, highlights in the sky) where the HDR seems a little too much.', '2012-12-26 19:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942207, 1046369, 78196, '<td valign="top">Although the flash highlights the main focus of the image, I don''t think the foreground has enough interest to justify the status you''ve given it - would prefer to see a more balanced exposure and more of the grassy background. That said, I really like the colours and composition.</td>', 'Although the flash highlights the main focus of the image, I don''t think the foreground has enough interest to justify the status you''ve given it - would prefer to see a more balanced exposure and more of the grassy background. That said, I really like the colours and composition.', '2012-12-26 19:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942210, 1046398, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice image &amp; well-controlled exposure.  Tenuous link to the challenge though - if you have to justify it in the title it probably isn''t close enough!</td>', 'Nice image & well-controlled exposure.  Tenuous link to the challenge though - if you have to justify it in the title it probably isn''t close enough!', '2012-12-26 19:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942212, 1046340, 78196, '<td valign="top">Not the most polished image on a photographic level (as I''m sure you know) but I want you to know that I enjoyed this.  The grain and the light give the melting snowman a vaguely unsettling air...</td>', 'Not the most polished image on a photographic level (as I''m sure you know) but I want you to know that I enjoyed this.  The grain and the light give the melting snowman a vaguely unsettling air...', '2012-12-26 19:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942214, 1046395, 78196, '<td valign="top">Spent a good while looking for the woman in the this &amp; quite enjoyed the challenge - can see one in the lower right side of the image, but there''s an eye on the left...  Are we looking at sand? I''m not sure it''s clear enough that we''re looking at an effect of water.</td>', 'Spent a good while looking for the woman in the this & quite enjoyed the challenge - can see one in the lower right side of the image, but there''s an eye on the left...  Are we looking at sand? I''m not sure it''s clear enough that we''re looking at an effect of water.', '2012-12-26 19:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942215, 1046362, 78196, '<td valign="top">The sky is lovely and i can see why you wanted to bring out the silhouettes.  The colours and composition are great, actually.  For me, though, the processing is overdone in that it has created dark, muddy patches among the trees'' smaller branches.</td>', 'The sky is lovely and i can see why you wanted to bring out the silhouettes.  The colours and composition are great, actually.  For me, though, the processing is overdone in that it has created dark, muddy patches among the trees'' smaller branches.', '2012-12-26 19:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942216, 1046397, 78196, '<td valign="top">Great colours and DoF</td>', 'Great colours and DoF', '2012-12-26 19:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942217, 1045540, 78196, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image.  Spent ages looking at this without gaining any real idea of what I was looking at.  I imagine most voters will probably want more of a clue!</td>', 'Intriguing image.  Spent ages looking at this without gaining any real idea of what I was looking at.  I imagine most voters will probably want more of a clue!', '2012-12-26 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942218, 1046373, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative, I hope this does well.</td>', 'Very imaginative, I hope this does well.', '2012-12-26 19:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942219, 1046400, 78196, '<td valign="top">I think and hope I''m looking at a ribbon-winner.  Beautifully composed and perfectly edited.  Brought a real smile to my face!</td>', 'I think and hope I''m looking at a ribbon-winner.  Beautifully composed and perfectly edited.  Brought a real smile to my face!', '2012-12-26 19:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942221, 1045684, 78196, '<td valign="top">Although this has a little hint of over-sharpening in the bird, it''s very nicely composed with pleasing DoF.  Link to the challenge perhaps a little tenuous!</td>', 'Although this has a little hint of over-sharpening in the bird, it''s very nicely composed with pleasing DoF.  Link to the challenge perhaps a little tenuous!', '2012-12-26 19:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942223, 1046067, 78196, '<td valign="top">Oh I do love a nice B&amp;W conversion and you''ve completely nailed this one.  Must have been spectacular to have witnessed the scene in person.  Wish I could vote, but I hope others will give this the high score it merits.</td>', 'Oh I do love a nice B&W conversion and you''ve completely nailed this one.  Must have been spectacular to have witnessed the scene in person.  Wish I could vote, but I hope others will give this the high score it merits.', '2012-12-26 19:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942224, 1046404, 78196, '<td valign="top">The idea is a nice one but I think it needs much much more contrast to make the details pop out.</td>', 'The idea is a nice one but I think it needs much much more contrast to make the details pop out.', '2012-12-26 19:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6942225, 1046341, 78196, '<td valign="top">This has a very nice, otherworldly, Middle Earth-esque feel to it.  Splash of colour from the leaves livens up the image.  Tiny bit too much HDR for my taste.</td>', 'This has a very nice, otherworldly, Middle Earth-esque feel to it.  Splash of colour from the leaves livens up the image.  Tiny bit too much HDR for my taste.', '2012-12-26 19:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
