(6944941, 1045695, 104230, '<td valign="top">It''s a tough environment for these boats...  Reminds me of our periodic trips to New Bedford when we''re always drawn to the piers to look at and photograph the fishing boats. Great capture of their wonderful colors and form/shape (voted earlier).</td>', 'It''s a tough environment for these boats...  Reminds me of our periodic trips to New Bedford when we''re always drawn to the piers to look at and photograph the fishing boats. Great capture of their wonderful colors and form/shape (voted earlier).', '2012-12-30 17:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6944944, 1046328, 104230, '<td valign="top">I''m really enjoying the contrast between the peaks in sunlight and the foreground and FWIW I don''t object to there being snow.  The foreground is reminding me of a wood cut or etching I think because of the very dark areas along each ridge top, an effect I like.</td>', 'I''m really enjoying the contrast between the peaks in sunlight and the foreground and FWIW I don''t object to there being snow.  The foreground is reminding me of a wood cut or etching I think because of the very dark areas along each ridge top, an effect I like.', '2012-12-30 17:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
