(6945309, 1046384, 114285, '<td valign="top">It will be interesting to see how this fares, it''s a great pic, I''ve always loved these huts, but whether it fits the challenge is another thing, I guess I''m looking it at the POV that if you get wet, then you eventually need somewhere to change, and the huts would suffice, still time will tell, actually in 13 mins.</td>', 'It will be interesting to see how this fares, it''s a great pic, I''ve always loved these huts, but whether it fits the challenge is another thing, I guess I''m looking it at the POV that if you get wet, then you eventually need somewhere to change, and the huts would suffice, still time will tell, actually in 13 mins.', '2012-12-30 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
