(6945798, 1045695, 101707, '<td valign="top">I want to thank everyone for their votes and nice comments. I never thought that this would do so well, and especially not ribbon. It was sitting above 7.000 until vote 63, then started to slide. Oh well, not complaining. To <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96530" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Brent_S</a> this was shot at Fisherman''s Terminal. It was freezing cold that day, between rain storms. To <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=78196" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">figaro</a> I would have liked to get different compositions, but to the left the boat''s prows were in the water. There would be no way to do that logistically.</td>', 'I want to thank everyone for their votes and nice comments. I never thought that this would do so well, and especially not ribbon. It was sitting above 7.000 until vote 63, then started to slide. Oh well, not complaining. To  Brent_S this was shot at Fisherman''s Terminal. It was freezing cold that day, between rain storms. To  figaro I would have liked to get different compositions, but to the left the boat''s prows were in the water. There would be no way to do that logistically.', '2012-12-31 14:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6945802, 1046397, 14476, '<td valign="top">Super congratulations, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=104230" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">PennyClick</a>!<br/>Heh, heh.  next time, YOU take the red.</td>', 'Super congratulations,  PennyClick!Heh, heh.  next time, YOU take the red.', '2012-12-31 14:49:14.000000', NULL, 0),
