(6958823, 1046318, 153814, '<td valign="top">I know it''s been a while since this challenge finished but after looking back I think I made a big mistake when I voted on this.<br/>I was clearly outsmarted by your creativity. Posthumous said it perfectly "Water is invisible. Only its effects can be seen".<br/>Im sorry I wish I was smarter and got this the first time around.<br/>Not only is it a great shot it meets the challenge to a "T".<br/>This type of imagination should be rewarded not the other way around.<br/>For the 4 people who gave the 9''s &amp; 10''s I applaud your vision.</td>', 'I know it''s been a while since this challenge finished but after looking back I think I made a big mistake when I voted on this.I was clearly outsmarted by your creativity. Posthumous said it perfectly "Water is invisible. Only its effects can be seen".Im sorry I wish I was smarter and got this the first time around.Not only is it a great shot it meets the challenge to a "T".This type of imagination should be rewarded not the other way around.For the 4 people who gave the 9''s & 10''s I applaud your vision.', '2013-01-16 09:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
